                    P("Important: which sections appear depends on the selected game. Per-wheel games (AC EVO, Assetto Corsa) show the tyre-force sections; column-force games (RaceRoom, Le Mans Ultimate) show the Core Force section instead; ACC shows a slimmed-down set. This guide describes everything — you will only see the sections your game supports."),
