                    Hsl("Engine Off Scale", "0 – 2", "Force multiplier with the engine off — like a dead car with no power steering: heavier, rubbery resistance."),
                    Hsl("Engine On Scale", "0 – 1", "Force multiplier with the engine running — power assist makes it lighter. Lower = lighter steering effort when idling."),
                    Hsl("Elastic Stretch", "0.001 – 0.05", "How far the tyre deforms elastically before it breaks free. Smaller = sharper breakaway, more 'clunk' when it lets go; larger = more rubbery, gradual feel. Default 0.01."),
                    Hsl("Spring Stiffness", "1 – 50", "How quickly the resistance builds in the elastic zone. Higher = stiffer initial resistance when you start turning at a standstill. Default 15."),
